# Both transactions share the key range, then each asks for an exclusive point.
# T1 waits for T2's shared range; T2's request closes the cycle, so T2 is the
# deadlock victim and T1's update proceeds once T2's locks are released.
MODE PESSIMISTIC
ROW 0 1
ROW 1 2

T1 READ_FOR_SHARE
T2 READ_FOR_SHARE
T1 UPDATE 0 10
T2 UPDATE 1 20
T1 READ
T1 COMMIT
T2 COMMIT
